      "writtenOn": "2025-01-23T16:15:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That makes sense, `VkPipelineMultisampleStateCreateInfo::sampleShadingEnable` is awlays set to VK_FAST and we don\u0027t use the `SampleRateShading` except with those restricted shader modes. Why is there a dependency on fragmentStoresAndAtomics\u003dfalse for this though?",
      "parentUuid": "87ed708b_a501e0ef",
      "revId": "750052550f1edc87cefca5be66d124e232ce7dc7",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
